{"server":"cn","storyId":"act17side_level_act17side_st10","groupId":"act17side","stageId":"act17side_09","title":"甲板室","storyCode":"SN-ST-10","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act17side/level_act17side_st10.txt","sourceHash":"a99fa7daf68980eb0581f64cfef3ef0be95f07efac693ded9cf9aed982a5e570","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"围猎就要结束，阿玛雅却横插一脚，拦住了幽灵鲨。海嗣成功进入了海中等待进化，而刚刚踏上旅途的凯尔希与卡门，尚不知能否赶上。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g25_goldenboat_core"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你浪费了机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是我，在盐风城抓住那只会说话的海嗣时，我会逼迫它说出它所知的关于阿戈尔的全部。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在陆地上行走了数年。你从未听见过阿戈尔的讯息。但海洋不同，海洋从未断绝过联系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就这么放任它死去，没有创造任何价值。低效的决策，歌蕾蒂娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"垃圾的讯息，我不需要。猎物给出的答案充斥着下级思维。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来你在陆地上找到了帮手，并倾注了相当的信任。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最后的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（尖啸）群星......墓地......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你手下留情了。他怎么还站着？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他只是比我想象中要更结实一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最后的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"骑士没有还击。他突然呆立在原地，随后抬头，蹒跚着，盘旋着，看着上方。\n歌蕾蒂娅本打算乘机结束这场追逐，但下一刻，她同样产生了一股隐隐的预感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......海嗣的气味，在变化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已经敏锐到能捕捉到它们的变化了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就对了，歌蕾蒂娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论你怎么安慰其他人和你自己，这才是我们迟早要面对的难题——我们自己。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g23_goldenboat_pass"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船长阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......加西亚！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大副","speakerId":"avg_npc_452_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（呜咽般的鸣叫）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船长阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好......好......你让它受了重伤！我们顺着血迹找，我们很快就会回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船长阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，这些烧毁的痕迹是什么？它对我的船做了什么？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......这不可能是那个怪物留下的痕迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说得对。这是我们可爱的伊比利亚小鸟留下的，多稀奇呀，在这短短的时间里，她能成长到这样的地步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海嗣和这样的人谁比较可怕呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船长阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那个旧伊比利亚人？她？不可能，这艘船上随便一个身经百战的水手都比她要强。她怎么能做到？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大副","speakerId":"avg_npc_452_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（轻咬船长的袖子）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船长阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船长阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论......无论那个旧伊比利亚人做了什么，我们都得抓紧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船长阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该结束这场持续数月的狩猎了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您看上去有些高兴，船长先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船长阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"高兴？哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船长阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"漫长的狩猎迎来了结局，谁会不高兴？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船长阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们继续追，我走另一条路。它凿不穿这里的墙壁......它会去更接近海的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船长阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"加西亚......你的伤并不致命，坚强点，我们很快回来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大副","speakerId":"avg_npc_452_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"负伤的大副还需要时间恢复。它默默看着船长的脸。\n欣喜。难以掩饰的兴奋。还有久违的活力。\n它放心地小睡片刻，集中精力恢复受伤的部分，以便帮助自己的爱人继续狩猎。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"那是一个小小的梦境。短暂，恍惚，在肉体遭受巨大变化之后，这种情况就显得尤为少见。\n梦里，是伊比利亚的海岸。漫天的礼花和轰鸣的汽笛。意气风发的阿方索站在它的身旁，问了它一个问题。\n加西亚。\n看见岸边的那些孩子了吗？我们都很喜欢孩子。\n孩子是伊比利亚的未来。我们的荣誉，战功，一身本领，都会随着生命消亡。\n但是，孩子，新的生命，伊比利亚共同养育的生命，会继承这一切。\n加西亚。\n你觉得他该戴你我的哪顶帽子？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g22_goldenboat_hall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（受了伤还能这么迅速地移动......追不上它！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（而且......勉强激发手炮......稍微有些......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"溟痕......连船上都......怎么会？！刚才还没有这么严重！"},{"type":"narration","text":"荧光的溟痕吞噬着伊比利亚黄金的大厅。\n精致的穹顶反射着幽蓝色的光芒。在光芒的中央，站着一个格格不入的女性。\n她双手交叉在前，沉默不语，细细打量着面前的王座。溟痕在她的脚下蔓延，黄金因她而失去色彩。\n她转过头。眼中只有慈悯与期待。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......晚上好，艾丽妮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（深海教徒！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没砍到——？！不、不对！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"源石技艺？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"答对了，艾丽妮，如果达里奥看到你如今的模样，一定会倍感欣喜吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——你为什么知道我和长官的名字？你是谁？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是个翻译家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这种谎言你觉得还有意义吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我从不说谎，艾丽妮。我翻译了许多著作，也许你书架上的高卢批判现实主义小说，就是出自我手呢？你关注过翻译的名字吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看看你的脚下！溟痕是你带来的？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个说法稍有偏颇，并非是我带来的溟痕......而是我，与发光的海洋建立了联系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很荣幸成为它的一部分，真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你是怎么登上这艘船的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不重要，艾丽妮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是否能打败海嗣，我是否会丧命于此，这艘船到底能不能成为与阿戈尔重建联系的关键，这些都不重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊......达里奥与惩戒军的牺牲，格兰法洛的崩溃，伊比利亚之眼，漫长的时间......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在进化蜕变的浩瀚进程中，这一切都只是生命溅起的些微水花罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我尊重，是因为我们都只是其中一环。对于整体而言，则显得微不足道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——等等。你说，长官，怎么了......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，可怜的艾丽妮......你看，我一直有问必答，但你真的需要在大敌当前的时候知道这种答案吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他的牺牲毫无意义，艾丽妮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海风带来了他死亡的消息。我很遗憾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不可能......不可能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没什么不可能的，艾丽妮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在神谕降下的时刻，这片大地的种种未来就都被确定了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们是匍匐于地的虫子。我们应当顺应命运。选择一个没有隔阂、没有区别，不再有国家与形态之分的生命，又有什么错呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你如果放弃抵抗，那再好不过。可如果......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——如果真的有那么无所谓，阿玛雅，你就别帮那只受伤的小猎物拖延时间呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"劳伦缇娜，你醒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还不完全，但起码我已经记起你的名字来了，阿玛雅。希望这不会显得太失礼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"艾丽妮！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......你对她做了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么，只是一些闲谈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯卡蒂。你去追吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"不是你的猎物吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁让我看见了一位更令人怀念的人物呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......好，你小心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"艾丽妮？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你撒谎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海风不会撒谎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。我刚才就说，这是不可能的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"长官的死一定是有意义的。审判庭不存在“无意义的牺牲”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你认为没有，深海教徒......那么我们会让其意义得以展现。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧......真是坚强的孩子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"猎人，我们走！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小艾丽妮......刚能掌握审判庭手炮的威力，就这么显摆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再这样粗暴地烧毁溟痕，阿方索船长恐怕会暴跳如雷吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就这么看着她们走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......我可不像昆图斯那么性急。同时面对两位猎人，我的生命岂不是太短暂了些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一瞬间和一刹那有区别吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有，但看见你变回以前的脾气还真让人怀念，劳伦缇娜。毕竟第一项实验开始前，你一直都是昏迷状态。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"离开我们之后，你过得还好吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"幽灵鲨轻微笑了笑。\n这是她今晚最美的一次笑容。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g23_goldenboat_pass"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"它的速度在变快！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经......哈啊......给它身上开了两个洞了，它的血液是无穷的吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"两个洞......你是怎么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个之后再说，我估计自己也不剩多少力气了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——它在一路捕食同类！难怪！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"小心，它来了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"——唔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_456_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Ishar-mla，祂在哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_456_1","isRemote":false,"text":"答案，我想得到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怪物！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"海嗣在艾丽妮激发手炮之前就俯下了身子。\n随着墙壁的碎裂声，借力回跳的斯卡蒂几乎瞬间回到了海嗣的面前。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"极限的一剑，仍旧落空。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（竟然全都避开了？！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_456_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不够。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_456_1","isRemote":false,"text":"营养，时间，不够。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_456_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Ishar-mla，我们需要答案。但是，我能感到祂存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_456_1","isRemote":false,"text":"话语，我会讨要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_456_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Ishar-mla，纵使没有回答，不代表，祂不在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_456_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祂不在，亦不代表，族群，失去方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_456_1","isRemote":false,"text":"方向，族群把握。我们，自行把握。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_456_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生存，唯一目标。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"你们总是喜欢一边嘀咕一边厮杀吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"别想那么复杂，也别打算回到海里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_456_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——还不够。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_456_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但，就快了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"——！捂上耳朵！艾丽妮！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_456_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（尖锐的咆哮）——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g25_goldenboat_core"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最后的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（沙哑的呢喃）罗辛——南特——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗辛南特","speakerId":"avg_npc_463_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嘶鸣）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最后的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巨浪将至，我们等待，我们去外面等待，武器，撕扯——我们走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗辛南特","speakerId":"avg_npc_463_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（呼应的嘶鸣）"},{"type":"narration","text":"远处传来海嗣的低鸣。歌蕾蒂娅微微皱眉。\n只是一个陆地人，鲁莽地接触大海，赢得了永恒的失心疯，这并不难理解。\n那么另一只服从于他的海嗣？\n但歌蕾蒂娅并没有细想。因为某种令人厌恶的预感正在刺激她的神经——\n——让她脖颈发痒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在上面发生了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这艘船在海上漂了六十多年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果它们不愿意见到这艘船，或者，它们执意要毁掉这艘船，把船上的人都当做敌人，那么“愚人号”早就沉没了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......所以它们接纳了它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它们将这艘船视作了环境的一部分。无论出于什么目的，它们一定允许这艘船存在于它们的海面上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但现在，情况不同了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"溟痕？什么时候......这个速度......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这艘船的沉没已经是板上钉钉的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"歌蕾蒂娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有没有想过，布雷奥甘这样的阿戈尔人才，为什么在最后一刻，选择将钥匙制成了“这个模样”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这本该是阿戈尔梦寐以求的秘密的钥匙，是他的心血结晶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那为什么谁的血液都能打开它？为什么他会任由钥匙落入一个脆弱的骑士手中？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们让那玩意儿闭了嘴。但他们可能根本不需要什么神。只有脆弱虚伪的人类才会合拢双手，向大海过多地祈祷，得到过多的慰藉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们争取到的时间很有限，歌蕾蒂娅。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g24_cloudy_sea"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"您还在想蒂亚戈的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，不完全是。在我所经历的诸多悲剧之中，他没有什么值得特别在意的，就像沙滩上的沙子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是沙滩上，有多少沙子呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这艘船并非惩戒军准备的。大部分船只都被纳入了惩戒军的管辖，只有极少数......被忘记的，搁浅在岸边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"现在看上去，我们因为某位惩戒军幕僚人员的粗心大意而省了不少功夫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是在想，我们会忘记多少东西，让多少东西搁浅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希，如果泰拉大地是一艘船，你觉得是一艘怎样的船？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......伊比利亚之眼就快到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凯尔希"]},{"speakerId":"char_263_skadi","aliases":["斯卡蒂"]}]}
